<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 Thesalonika</book>
  <para style="h">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawl, Silvanus hoi Timote mah aicae Ampa Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri ah kaom Thesalonika vangpui ih kricaabunawk khaeah ca tarik:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />aicae Ampa Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri khae hoi ih tahmenhaih hoi monghaih nangcae khaeah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae tanghaih qoeng tahang aep moe, maeto hoi maeto amlunghaih bangah na pung o tahang pongah, Sithaw khaeah anghoehaih lawk kang thuih pae o toepsoep han oh, ka thuih o han roe oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nangcae loe pacaekthlaekhaih hoi raihaih to na tong o, toe tanghaih hoi pauephaih to na tawnh o pongah, Sithaw kricaabunawk salakah nangcae to kam oek o haih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />nangcae loe Sithaw mah siangpahrang ah uk ih prae hanah ni patang na khang o, to pongah Sithaw mah siangpahrang ah uk ih prae thungah akun han krah kami ah tapomhaih to na hnu o tih, to loe katoeng Sithaw lokcaekhaih amtuengsak hanah angmathaih maeto ah oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nangcae raihaih paek kaminawk lu lak hanah Sithaw mah katoeng ah lokcaek tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />thacak angmah ih van kaminawk hoi nawnto van hoiah Angraeng Jesu amtueng naah, nangcae raihaih tong kaminawk loe kaicae hoi nawnto anghak tih boeh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sithaw panoek ai kaminawk hoi aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri ih tamthanglok hoih tahngai ai kaminawk loe hmai kamngaeh hoiah lu la tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />lensawk a thacakhaih hoiah nihcae to Angraeng hmaa hoiah tapraek ueloe, dungzan amrohaih hoiah danpaek tih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih angzoh na niah loe, angmah ih kaciim kaminawk mah Anih to saphaw o ueloe, (nangcae khaeah ka thuih o ih lok to na tang o pongah) tangcaanawk boih mah pakoeh o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih mah kawk ih kami hoi kamcuk ah kho na sak o thai hanah, nangcae han lawk kang thuih pae o toepsoep; na tang o haih rang hoiah kahoih hmuennawk boih koep ah na sak o thai hanah, anih mah thacakhaih to na paek o tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To naah aicae Ampa Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih baktih toengah, nangcae mah aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri ih ahmin to na pakoeh o thaih ueloe, nangcae doeh Anih rang hoiah pakoeh ah na om o tih boeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri angzoh naah, anih tongh hanah aicae loe nawnto amkhueng o tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />muithla rang hoiah maw, to tih ai boeh loe kami mah thuih ih lok hoiah maw, to tih ai boeh loe capat kroekhaih hoiah maw, Kri loe angzoh boeh, tiah nihcae mah thuih o naah mawn o hmah loe, tasoehhaih palungthin doeh tawn o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi mah doeh na ling o hmah nasoe: kami zae, anghmaa angtaa capa to amtueng moe, tanghaih bangah amtimh ving kami angzo hmaloe ai ah loe, to Ani to pha mak ai vop.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />To kami mah loe Sithaw kawk kami hoi Sithaw bok kaminawk boih to koeh ai, angmah hoi angmah to Sithaw pong kasang ah amkoeh; anih loe Sithaw ih tempul ah Sithaw baktiah anghnut moe, Sithaw baktiah angsahcop kami ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangcae khae ka oh naah, kang thuih o ih hae loknawk hae na pahnet o boeh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Angmah ih atue phak naah anih amtueng thai hanah, anih patawnkung loe mi maw, tito vaihi na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kasae kami loe tamquta hoi tok a sak boeh; anih loe vaihi anih Patawnkung Anih to toksakhaih thung hoi takhoe ving ai karoek to toksah vop tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Patawnkung Anih to takhoe ving pacoengah loe, kasae kami to amtueng tih boeh, to kami to Anih mah angmah pakha thung ih takhi hoiah hum tih, Anih angzoh naah kaom lensawk aanghaih mah to kami to amrosak tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />to kasae kami loe Setan toksakhaih hoiah angzo ueloe, alinghaih hoiah sakthaihaih, angmathaih hoi dawnrai hmuennawk boih to sah tih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nihcae pahlong thai hanah, loktang amlunghaih to talawk o ai pongah, anghmaa angtaa kaminawk khaeah katoeng ai congca alinghaih to patoh tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Alinghaih lok to nihcae mah tang o thai hanah, Sithaw mah nihcae khaeah thacak zoekhaih to phasak tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />loktang lok tanghaih katawn ai, katoeng ai loklam bangah kanawm acaeng kaminawk boih lokcaekhaih to om tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Angraeng mah palung ih nawkamyanawk, Muithla ciimsakhaih hoi loktang lok tanghaih rang hoiah pahlong ah oh thai hanah, tangsuek nathuem hoiah Sithaw mah ang qoih o boeh, to pongah nangcae han Sithaw khaeah anghoehaih lawk ka thuih o toepsoep han oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri lensawkhaih hnuk han ih ni, aicae ih kahoih tamthanglok hoiah anih mah to tiah ang kawk o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />To pongah nawkamyanawk, kacakah angdoe oh loe, lokthuihaih hoiah maw, to tih ai boeh loe capat hoiah maw kang patuk o ih khosakhaih atawk to kacakah patawn oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aicae palung pongah, aicae han tahmenhaih, kahoih oephaih hoi dungzan monghaih paekkung, aicae Ampa, Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri angmah roe mah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />na poek o haih palungthin monghaih to paek nasoe loe, kahoih lokthuihaih hoi toksakhaih to caksak boih nasoe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnukkhuem koekah, nawkamyanawk, Angraeng ih lok nangcae thungah oh baktih toengah, tamthanglok to karangah pung moe, lensawkhaih amtueng thai han hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kami boih mah tanghaih tawn o ai pongah, tidoeh kavang ai kami hoi kasae kaminawk ban thung hoiah ka loih o thai hanah, kaicae han lawk na thui pae oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Toe Angraeng loe oepthoh, anih mah tha na cak o sak ueloe, kahoih ai hmuen thung hoiah na loih o sak tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kang thuih o ih hmuennawk na sak o baktih toengah, na sah o poe tih, tiah Angraeng hmin hoi oephaih ka tawnh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Angraeng mah nangcae ih palungthin to Sithaw amlunghaih hoi Kri palungsawkhaih bangah caeh haih nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, kaicae khae hoi nam tuk o ih khosakhaih baktih toengah khosah ai kami, amsoem ai ah khosah kaminawk khae hoi kamhoe ah na oh o thai hanah, Angraeng Jesu Kri ih ahmin hoiah kang pacae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kaicae khosakhaih dan kawbangmaw pazui han, tito na panoek o, kaicae loe nangcae mik hnukah khet kamcuk ai ah kho ka sah o vai ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />minawk ih buh doeh azom ah ka caa o vai ai; nangcae khaeah kaom mi kawbaktih doeh hmuenzit ka phawh o sak han ai ah, aqum athun karai tok to ka sak o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />sakthaihaih akaa ka tawn o ai, tiah thuihaih ih na ai ni, nangcae mah kuu na lak o thai hanah, ka sak o ih baktih toengah na sak o pazui han ih ni, nangcae khet koi kaom ah tok ka sak o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangcae khae ka oh o naah, hae lok hae kang thuih o boeh, toksak koeh ai kami loe buh caa hmah nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangcae khaeah khet kamcuk ah khosah ai kami, minawk raihaih paek thoemto kaminawk oh o ti, tiah ka thaih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />To kaminawk loe lok angaekhaih om ai ah tok a sak o moe, angmacae ih buh to caak o hanah, Angraeng Jesu Kri rang hoiah thapaekhaih lok ka thuih pae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe nawkamyanawk, kahoih hmuen sak han hmawt o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hae capat thungah tarik ih lok tapom ai kami loe, to kami to panoek oh loe, anih azat thai hanah, anih hoi angkom o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toe anih to misa baktiah poek o hmah, amnawkamya baktiah thuitaek oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Angdaehhaih Angraeng angmah roe mah, hmuen boih pongah dungzan monghaih na paek o nasoe. Nangcae boih khaeah Angraeng om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hae ban sinhaih ca loe capat boih thungah angmathaih capat maeto ah oh pongah, kai Pawl mah kaimah ih ban hoi roe ni ka tarik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih nangcae boih nuiah om nasoe.
  </para>
</usx>
